ilures.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Add a &#39;Wait for element&#39; or &#39;Delay&#39; action between UI automation steps to improve reliability.</system-out></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[missing-retry] Transient operation without retry @missing-retr" time="0"><system-out>This network/external service action is prone to transient failures (timeouts, rate limits, connection resets) but has no retry mechanism or error handler.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Wrap this action in a loop with a retry counter and delay, or add an &#39;On Block Error&#39; handler that implements retry logic.</system-out></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[missing-retry] Transient operation without retry @missing-retr" time="0"><system-out>This network/external service action is prone to transient failures (timeouts, rate limits, connection resets) but has no retry mechanism or error handler.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Wrap this action in a loop with a retry counter and delay, or add an &#39;On Block Error&#39; handler that implements retry logic.</system-out></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[missing-retry] Transient operation without retry @missing-retr" time="0"><system-out>This network/external service action is prone to transient failures (timeouts, rate limits, connection resets) but has no retry mechanism or error handler.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Wrap this action in a loop with a retry counter and delay, or add an &#39;On Block Error&#39; handler that implements retry logic.</system-out></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[missing-retry] Transient operation without retry @missing-retr" time="0"><system-out>This network/external service action is prone to transient failures (timeouts, rate limits, connection resets) but has no retry mechanism or error handler.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Wrap this action in a loop with a retry counter and delay, or add an &#39;On Block Error&#39; handler that implements retry logic.</system-out></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[missing-timeout] Network operation without timeout @missing-time" time="0"><failure type="warning" message="Network operation without timeout">This network/UI automation action has no explicit timeout configured. If the target is unresponsive, the flow will hang indefinitely.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Set an explicit timeout value in the action&#39;s properties. For web automation, use &#39;Wait for element&#39; with a timeout instead of relying on default behavior.</failure></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[missing-timeout] Network operation without timeout @missing-time" time="0"><failure type="warning" message="Network operation without timeout">This network/UI automation action has no explicit timeout configured. If the target is unresponsive, the flow will hang indefinitely.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Set an explicit timeout value in the action&#39;s properties. For web automation, use &#39;Wait for element&#39; with a timeout instead of relying on default behavior.</failure></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[missing-timeout] Network operation without timeout @missing-time" time="0"><failure type="warning" message="Network operation without timeout">This network/UI automation action has no explicit timeout configured. If the target is unresponsive, the flow will hang indefinitely.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Set an explicit timeout value in the action&#39;s properties. For web automation, use &#39;Wait for element&#39; with a timeout instead of relying on default behavior.</failure></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[resource-leak] Resource opened but never closed @resource-lea" time="0"><failure type="warning" message="Resource opened but never closed">This action opens a Excel instance (stored in %ExcelInstance%) but no matching close action was found in the flow.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Add a &#39;Excel.Close&#39; action to release the resource. Place it inside an &#39;On Block Error&#39; handler to guarantee cleanup even on failure.</failure></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[resource-leak] Resource opened but never closed @resource-lea" time="0"><failure type="warning" message="Resource opened but never closed">This action opens a database connection (stored in %SQLConnection%) but no matching close action was found in the flow.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Add a &#39;Database.Close&#39; action to release the resource. Place it inside an &#39;On Block Error&#39; handler to guarantee cleanup even on failure.</failure></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[slow-pattern] UI automation in tight loop @slow-pattern" time="0"><failure type="warning" message="UI automation in tight loop">This loop contains UI/web automation actions without any delay, which can overwhelm the target application.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Add a &#39;Wait&#39; or &#39;Delay&#39; action inside the loop to reduce load on the target application.</failure></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[sql-injection-risk] SQL injection risk @sql-injectio" time="0"><failure type="warning" message="SQL injection risk">SQL statement interpolates variables directly. A malicious value could alter the query.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Use parameterized queries (@paramName or ? placeholders) instead of embedding %variables% directly in the SQL string.</failure></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[subflow-no-error-handler] Subflow without error handler @subflow-no-e" time="0"><system-out>Subflow &#34;Main&#34; has action blocks but no error handler. Unhandled errors will silently terminate the subflow.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Add a Try/Catch or On Block Error handler to protect against unexpected failures.</system-out></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[unhandled-error] Unhandled error in fallible action @unhandled-er" time="0"><failure type="warning" message="Unhandled error in fallible action">This action commonly fails but has no error handler in its surrounding scope.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Wrap this action in a Try/Catch block or add error handler logic to recover from failures.</failure></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[unhandled-error] Unhandled error in fallible action @unhandled-er" time="0"><failure type="warning" message="Unhandled error in fallible action">This action commonly fails but has no error handler in its surrounding scope.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Wrap this action in a Try/Catch block or add error handler logic to recover from failures.</failure></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[unhandled-error] Unhandled error in fallible action @unhandled-er" time="0"><failure type="warning" message="Unhandled error in fallible action">This action commonly fails but has no error handler in its surrounding scope.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Wrap this action in a Try/Catch block or add error handler logic to recover from failures.</failure></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[unhandled-error] Unhandled error in fallible action @unhandled-er" time="0"><failure type="warning" message="Unhandled error in fallible action">This action commonly fails but has no error handler in its surrounding scope.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Wrap this action in a Try/Catch block or add error handler logic to recover from failures.</failure></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[unhandled-error] Unhandled error in fallible action @unhandled-er" time="0"><failure type="warning" message="Unhandled error in fallible action">This action commonly fails but has no error handler in its surrounding scope.&#xA;&#xA;Suggestion: Wrap this action in a Try/Catch block or add error handler logic to recover from failures.</failure></testcase><testcase classname="=Invoices+Ops" name="[unhandled-error] Unhandled error in fallible action @unhandled-er" time="0"><failure type="warning" message="Unhandled error in fallible action">This action commonly fails but has no error